# ffmpeg flags that depend on the ISA rather than the OS. Layered on top of
# common/ffmpeg-features.<platform> by ffmpeg_features <platform> x86_64.
#
# Empty for now: libsvtjpegxs used to live here because upstream SVT-JPEG-XS is
# x86-only, but ossia/SVT-JPEG-XS builds on aarch64 too, so it moved back to the
# shared common/ffmpeg-features. The file stays so ffmpeg_features has a layer
# to read for this arch.
